{"asset_key":"ep2/env_story_12308310","episode":"ep2","category":"env_story","story_id":"12308310","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1230831001:1":{"text":"えぇ、もう何日ここに閉じ込められていたことか！","source_cn":"我已经数不清自己被困在这座港口多少日子了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD07AA55EC07B2DA6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1230831002:1":{"text":"ようやくここを去ることができるというのに、なんだか現実味がないんです。","source_cn":"现在好不容易可以离开这里，我却突然感觉有些不真实。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x273501A32E9DD51E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1230831003:1":{"text":"次の瞬間には、また港を封鎖するという通達が出るんじゃないかと思ってしまいますよ。","source_cn":"仿佛下一刻，上城区又会传出通知，告诉我港口再次封锁。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4D8C46CED7F08024","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1230831004:1":{"text":"あぁデューラ様、どうか私を無事にラスティーアンカーから出してください！","source_cn":"艾雅保佑，请让我平安离开锈锚港吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8BA1C1964AED8F18","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:商人科博":{"text":"商人のコボ","source":"商人科博","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}